# Repo-wide ignores only. Each component keeps its own .gitignore for its own
# generated output -- see Ember-on-LMEnt/.gitignore (mf_outputs/, runs/),
# Untaught/.gitignore (runs/, trainer scratch) and ember_eval/.gitignore.
#
# Keep patterns here NARROW. Three blanket rules used to live in this file and
# each one silently dropped real source from the tree when the third-party forks
# were vendored in, because git add skips ignored paths without reporting it:
#
#   *.png       dropped 10 dolma doc assets and 1 OLMo-core asset, so several
#               vendored READMEs render with broken images.
#   *.csv       dropped olmes/oe_eval/dependencies/AGIEval/data/few_shot_prompts.csv,
#               which AGIEval's dataset_loader.py reads by path at runtime.
#   wikidata*   dropped ReFinED/src/refined/doc_preprocessing/wikidata_mapper.py,
#               a source module that ReFinED's own dataset_factory.py and
#               wikipedia_dataset.py import.
#
# If you need to exclude a large data artifact, scope the rule to the directory
# it lives in rather than matching an extension repo-wide.

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Logs and scheduler capture
*.log
**/slurm_output/

# Generic scratch output directories
output/
outputs/
